{
  "subject": "Your Gal Toolkit MAX subscription has been extended by one year",
  "text": "Hi {{first_name}},\n\nAs a thank-you for purchasing a Premiere Gal course, we have extended your Gal Toolkit MAX subscription by one year at no additional cost.\n\nThe extra year begins when your current subscription period ends, so you keep all the time you have already paid for.\n\nYour updated access:\n{{access_summary}}\n\nYour sign-in email: {{account_email}}\n\nThe extension has already been applied to your existing account. Sign in with your usual password or Continue with Google, if that is how you normally sign in.\n\nOpen Gal Toolkit MAX:\n{{login_url}}\n\nHappy editing,\nThe Premiere Gal Team\n\nYou are receiving this email because you purchased a Premiere Gal course and are eligible for Gal Toolkit MAX access.",
  "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Your Gal Toolkit MAX subscription has been extended by one year</title>\n<!--[if !mso]><!--><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><!--<![endif]-->\n<style>\nbody,table,td,a{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%}table,td{mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt}img{border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic}\n@media only screen and (max-width:620px){.outer{padding:20px 12px!important}.content{padding:28px 22px!important}.heading{font-size:30px!important;letter-spacing:-1px!important}.brand{font-size:17px!important}.account{padding:18px!important}.hero{width:100%!important;height:auto!important}.desktop-break{display:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ffffff;color:#211e29;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;\">A free year has been added after your current Gal Toolkit MAX subscription period ends.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\">\n<tr><td class=\"outer\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 16px;\">\n<!--[if mso]><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td><![endif]-->\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;\">\n<tr><td>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td width=\"54\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#F0F1F9\" style=\"width:54px;padding:8px;border-radius:16px;\"><a href=\"https://premieregal.motionflow.pro/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://premieregal.motionflow.pro/premiere-gal/assets/logo.png\" width=\"38\" height=\"40\" alt=\"Gal\" style=\"display:block;width:38px;height:40px;margin:0 auto;\"></a></td>\n<td width=\"12\" style=\"width:12px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#F0F1F9\" style=\"padding:15px 18px;border-radius:16px;\"><span class=\"brand\" style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\">Gal Toolkit MAX</span><br><span style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:16px;color:#665F72;\">by Premiere Gal</span></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td height=\"14\" style=\"height:14px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#F0F1F9\" style=\"padding:8px;border-radius:16px;\">\n<a href=\"https://premieregal.motionflow.pro/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img class=\"hero\" src=\"https://premieregal.motionflow.pro/premiere-gal/assets/hero.jpg\" width=\"584\" alt=\"Premiere Gal presents Gal Toolkit MAX\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:584px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;\"></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td height=\"14\" style=\"height:14px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"content\" bgcolor=\"#F0F1F9\" style=\"padding:34px 34px 30px;border-radius:16px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#6C14CF\" style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:99px;background-color:#6C14CF;background-image:linear-gradient(to right,#DE7ABE,#6C14CF);color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">YOUR COURSE BONUS</span></td></tr></table>\n<h1 class=\"heading\" style=\"margin:18px 0 22px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:38px;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-1.4px;font-weight:800;color:#211e29;\">Your subscription,<br class=\"desktop-break\"> plus one free year.</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:23px;\">Hi {{first_name}},</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;line-height:23px;color:#665F72;\">As a thank-you for purchasing a Premiere Gal course, we have extended your Gal Toolkit MAX subscription by <strong style=\"color:#211e29;font-weight:600;\">one year at no additional cost.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;line-height:23px;color:#665F72;\">The extra year begins when your current subscription period ends, so you keep all the time you have already paid for.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"border-radius:12px;\">\n<tr><td class=\"account\" style=\"padding:22px;border-radius:12px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;color:#211e29;\">Your updated access</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:#665F72;\">{{access_summary}}</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:10px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:0.7px;font-weight:600;color:#665F72;\">YOUR SIGN-IN EMAIL</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;font-weight:600;color:#2c2839;word-break:break-all;\">{{account_email}}</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:22px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:22px;color:#665F72;\">The extension has already been applied to your existing account. Sign in with your usual password or Continue with Google, if that is how you normally sign in.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#6C14CF\" style=\"border-radius:8px;background-color:#6C14CF;background-image:linear-gradient(to right,#DE7ABE,#6C14CF);mso-padding-alt:16px 24px;\">\n<a href=\"{{login_url}}\" style=\"display:block;padding:16px 24px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;color:#ffffff;\">Open Gal Toolkit MAX</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 24px;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;color:#665F72;text-align:center;\">Button not working? <a href=\"{{login_url}}\" style=\"color:#6C14CF;text-decoration:underline;\">Open Gal Toolkit MAX</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:22px;color:#665F72;\">Happy editing,<br><strong style=\"color:#2c2839;font-weight:600;\">The Premiere Gal Team</strong></p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:22px 16px 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#2c2839\" style=\"border-radius:8px;mso-padding-alt:13px 20px;\"><a href=\"https://premieregal.motionflow.pro/\" style=\"display:block;padding:13px 20px;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;\">Visit Gal Toolkit MAX</a></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:18px 0 0;font-size:10px;line-height:17px;color:#665F72;\">You are receiving this email because you purchased a Premiere Gal course<br class=\"desktop-break\"> and are eligible for Gal Toolkit MAX access.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:10px;line-height:17px;color:#665F72;\"><a href=\"https://premieregal.motionflow.pro/\" style=\"color:#665F72;text-decoration:none;\">premieregal.motionflow.pro</a></p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</td></tr></table>\n</body>\n</html>"
}
